claimed: deploy-name-and-orchestration -- two amendments to specs/deployment.md from the operator's framing (2026-09-07): (1) the module keeps the name okay-deploy and the new model grows INSIDE it -- a second module for the same domain would be the drift this repo's own rule warns about; (2) 'render, never orchestrate' is too blunt for what was asked: we DO orchestrate -- the tools, in dependency order, with one command -- and what we refuse to become is the RUNTIME that keeps a workload alive. Spec wording only.
